<title>SWEDEN: Moody's assigns Baa2 counterparty rating to Valmet.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Baa2 counterparty rating to Valmet.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Moody's said on Thursday it assigned a counterparty rating of Baa2 to Finnish paper and board machine maker Valmet Corporation.  </p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet issued a statement saying it had been assigned a rating of BBB+/A-2 by Standard &amp; Poor's, and a counterparty rating of Baa2 by Moody's.</p>
<p>&quot;The ratings from both leading credit rating agencies strengthen Valmet's position and expand its opportunities on the international financial markets,&quot; Valmet said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
